<title>EGYPT: Egypt cumulative cotton exports 62,970 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Egypt cumulative cotton exports 62,970 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt made new commitments to export 229 tonnes of cotton in the 27th week of the marketing season, bringing the total so far this season to 62,970 tonnes, the Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association (Alcotexa) said on Monday. The 27th week ended on Saturday.</p>
<p>The association approved the sale of 226 tonnes of Giza 76 to Japan and also of three tonnes left over from the 22nd week.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
